    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d313">

                <pb facs="0332" n="326" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg326"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Baker.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-08-16"><hi rendition="#italic">August 16,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your dispatch (344) received. Full advices from naval commanders show that very
                    few American citizens were concerned in the recent movement at Bluefields, and
                    none of good repute.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
